ng=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">23</span><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">日電）</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">台北市環保局今天說，國際碳揭露計畫組織近日公布</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">2018</span><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">年參與碳揭露的城市評分結果，全球</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">596</span><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">個城市中僅</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">43</span><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">個城市獲</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">A</span><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">等級，台灣則包含台北、台中和高雄同列為</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">A</span><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">等級。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">環保局發布新聞稿表示，國際碳揭露計畫（</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">CDP</span><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">）為獨立非營利組織，由國際法人投資機構如美林證券等單位發起，台北市自西元</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">2011</span><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">年起每年參與</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">CDP</span><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">計畫，每年提送溫室氣體減量成果，供該組織評估與揭露。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">環保局說，</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">CDP</span><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">成立以來，今年度也首次針對城市的碳揭露成果評分，並公布結果，全球只有</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">43</span><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">個城市榮獲</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">A</span><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">等級，台灣有包括台北、台中和高雄</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">3</span><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">個城市同列為</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">A</span><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">等級，該組織更以專文介紹台北市在溫室氣體減量與對抗氣候變遷的努力，像是採用綠建築和綠屋頂，以面對都市熱島效應，街道也鋪有透水材質鋪面等政策。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">環保局表示，該組織報告提及，</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">43</span><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">個榮獲</span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">A</span><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">等級的城市都是致力於降低溫室氣體排放、氣候變遷調適與水資源管理。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 21.33px; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; font-size: 21.33px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">環保局指出，未來也會配合國際努力節能減碳，並做好各項防範調適，並持續加強社區機關學校及工商業節能宣導補助，朝建構智慧城市、循環城市及宜居永續城市努力，也感謝民眾持續配合市府政策，向目標逐步邁進。（編輯：張銘坤）</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: &amp;quot;新細明體&amp;quot;,serif; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\\\">資料來源：</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: sans-serif,Arial,Verdana,&amp;quot;Trebuchet MS&amp;quot;; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"